# Force LF in the repository for every text file.
#
# This is a reproducibility control, not a style preference. HR-12.5 requires two
# builds of the same commit to be byte-identical, and a third party to be able to
# verify a binary against source. A checkout that rewrites line endings per
# platform means the "same commit" is not the same bytes on disk, which breaks
# source-hash verification and any signature computed over a source tree.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary: never touch.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.jar binary
*.keystore binary
*.apk binary
*.sig binary
